Z||000001||mshill||11-28-2000||05:26 PM||||The only bucking I have is the very first take off in first gear when cold.  Sounds like something is not quite right with your V6.  Since when it is cold it runs in Open Loop mode, I would suspect the TPS or MAT sensors first, then the ECU (computer).<BR>||||reg||1
